  {
    "id": "AR04",
    "title": "单层概率",
    "statement": "E=max(armorRating−armorPenetration,0)，均匀roll<E/2全挡，否则roll<E随机舍入减半，否则全伤。条件为严格小于。Rand.Value把Int32除4294967295后转float，可取0与1。连续均匀理想模型中E>1全伤概率0、E=2总全挡；实际显式roll=1时E=1走全伤、E=2走半伤。随机减半不是固定floor或Math.round。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "combat",
        "type": "Verse.ArmorUtility",
        "line_start": 58,
        "line_end": 90,
        "range_sha256": "c7f229f41b37f67234490c2119a76875b7587247e4e6c872a3a8a0aa053d5347"
      },
      {
