  {
    "id": "AR12",
    "title": "远程穿透边界",
    "statement": "ProjectileProperties无armorCategory返回0。有damageAmountBase或显式armorPenetrationBase时选后者，否则选DamageDef.defaultArmorPenetration；若仍<0，用无武器GetDamageAmount*.015；最后乘武器RangedWeapon_ArmorPenetrationMultiplier。该品质倍率.9/1/1/1/1/1.25/1.5。实际子弹把此AP传入DamageInfo。本包记录API与公式，不新增远程射击玩法。",
